participant User "ユーザー" actor
participant Client "フロントエンド"
participant API "APIサーバー"
participant DB "データベース"
msg User -> Client solid filled #1 "ログイン情報入力"
msg Client -> API solid filled #2 "POST /api/login (ID, PW)"
activate API
msg API -> DB solid filled #3 "ユーザー照会・パスワード照合"
msg DB -> API dotted filled #4 "照合成功"
msg API -> Client dotted filled #5 "200 OK (JWTトークン返却)"
deactivate API
note over Client,API "認証完了後のリクエスト"
msg Client -> API solid filled #6 "GET /api/data (Authorizationヘッダー)"
activate API
msg API -> DB solid filled #7 "データ取得クエリ"
msg DB -> API dotted filled #8 "レコード返却"
msg API -> Client dotted filled #9 "JSONデータ"
deactivate API
msg Client -> User dotted filled #10 "画面にデータ描画"
